cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the evaluation set or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "A support agent for @AmericanAir — and how far to trust it"
abstract: >-
  An intent-classifying, retrieval-grounded reply-drafting and escalation-routing
  customer-support agent built from the Kaggle Customer Support on Twitter dataset,
  with a hand-labelled evaluation set, two baselines, an independent LLM annotator and
  a logged account of what the headline numbers hide.
authors:
